From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Micheal Waltz <micheal@ecliptik.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:13:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] psDooM: processes as monsters, through libpsd

Hooks for the psdoom-plus glue (engines/common/psdoom in the psdoom-plus
tree), generated by tools/apply-dsda-hooks.py: pid monsters and their
floating labels (software renderer), damage/renice and death/kill,
-respawnitems, -nomonsters., the custom level, and psDooM's options past
the command-line check. Saves and key frames keep each monster's pid, and
PS_Resync() re-adopts them after a restore.
---
 prboom2/src/d_main.c    |  3 +++
 prboom2/src/dsda/args.c |  4 ++++
 prboom2/src/dsda/save.c |  2 ++
 prboom2/src/g_game.c    |  3 +++
 prboom2/src/m_menu.c    |  8 ++++----
 prboom2/src/p_inter.c   | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 prboom2/src/p_mobj.c    |  4 +++-
 prboom2/src/p_mobj.h    |  7 +++++++
 prboom2/src/p_setup.c   |  4 ++++
 prboom2/src/p_tick.c    |  2 ++
 prboom2/src/r_defs.h    |  5 +++++
 prboom2/src/r_things.c  | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 12 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

